Weave matter into your flesh, becoming incredibly resilient to damage.  While active you gain [19, 24, 29, 32, 35 (TL1-5; MAG 100)] armour, [10%, 23%, 31%, 38%, 43% (TL1-5)] resistance to stunning, and [10%, 23%, 31%, 38%, 43% (TL1-5)] resistance to cuts.

The bonus to armour will scale with your Magic.
